<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 150 tons of manganese ore.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 150 tons of manganese ore.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 150 short dry tons of metallurgical grade manganese ore valued at approximately $5,500, and 1,700 short dry tons of chemical grade manganese ore valued at approximately $133,000.</p>
<p>The sales were made to American Minerals Inc.</p>
<p>The next date for receiving bid offers is March 4.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
